 Sign in to another Claude Code account                                  in C:\Projects\quiz-slayer

 Devpit hands this window to Claude Code's own sign-in:
   claude auth login

 It opens your browser. Sign in there with the account you want to add. When it is done, Devpit
 comes back here and shows who signed in.

 Nothing is saved until you name the account. Ctrl+C in the sign-in stops it, and nothing is left
 behind.

 [enter] start sign-in  [esc] back













[keys] enter start sign-in
